{"id":"9a2eba7a6158f6b0","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-game4-zero-sum-normal-game.md","title":"ZFC Game4 Zero Sum Normal Game","display":"df-zfc-game4-zero-sum-normal-game — ZFC Game4 Zero Sum Normal Game","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-game4-zero-sum-normal-game","aliases":["58-df-zfc-game4-zero-sum-normal-game"],"display":"df-zfc-game4-zero-sum-normal-game — ZFC Game4 Zero Sum Normal Game","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-finite]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-game]]","[[58-df-product]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-game4-zero-sum-normal-game"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-game4-zero-sum-normal-game</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-game4-zero-sum-normal-game — ZFC Game4 Zero Sum Normal Game"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"58-df-finite\">58-df-finite</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2a48a890cd9aeba0\" href=\"?note=2a48a890cd9aeba0\" title=\"58-df-game\">58-df-game</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3579e07be41aa5cd\" href=\"?note=3579e07be41aa5cd\" title=\"58-df-product\">58-df-product</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N,\\vec S,\\vec u,\\mathcal S,\\mathcal U\\in V\">\\(N,\\vec S,\\vec u,\\mathcal S,\\mathcal U\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"58-df-finite\">58-df-finite</a>) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame4ZeroSumNormalGame}_S:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame4ZeroSumNormalGame}_S:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game4\\text{-}zero\\text{-}sum\\text{-}normal\\text{-}game} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGame4ZeroSumNormalGame}_S(N,\\vec S,\\vec u)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Finite}(N)\\land N\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\exists\\mathcal S,\\mathcal U\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec S,N,\\mathcal S)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec u,N,\\mathcal U)\\land\\forall i\\in N\\;\\bigl(\\vec S(i)\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec u(i),\\prod_{j\\in N}\\vec S(j),\\mathbb R)\\bigr)\\land\\forall s\\in\\prod_{i\\in N}\\vec S(i)\\;(\\sum_{i\\in N}\\vec u(i)(s)=0)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game4\\text{-}zero\\text{-}sum\\text{-}normal\\text{-}game} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGame4ZeroSumNormalGame}_S(N,\\vec S,\\vec u)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Finite}(N)\\land N\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\exists\\mathcal S,\\mathcal U\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec S,N,\\mathcal S)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec u,N,\\mathcal U)\\land\\forall i\\in N\\;\\bigl(\\vec S(i)\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec u(i),\\prod_{j\\in N}\\vec S(j),\\mathbb R)\\bigr)\\land\\forall s\\in\\prod_{i\\in N}\\vec S(i)\\;(\\sum_{i\\in N}\\vec u(i)(s)=0)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The strategy and payoff families are evaluated as the actual functions <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec S(i)\">\\(\\vec S(i)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec u(i)\">\\(\\vec u(i)\\)</span>; no unbound subscript variables <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_i,u_i\">\\(S_i,u_i\\)</span> remain.</li>\n<li>Every player's strategy set is required to be nonempty.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-finite","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-finite]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-game","status":"resolved","id":"2a48a890cd9aeba0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-game]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-product","status":"resolved","id":"3579e07be41aa5cd","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-product]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-finite","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-finite]]) and $\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-finite]]) and $\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"N,\\vec S,\\vec u,\\mathcal S,\\mathcal U\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcGame4ZeroSumNormalGame}_S:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game4\\text{-}zero\\text{-}sum\\text{-}normal\\text{-}game} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGame4ZeroSumNormalGame}_S(N,\\vec S,\\vec u)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Finite}(N)\\land N\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\exists\\mathcal S,\\mathcal U\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec S,N,\\mathcal S)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec u,N,\\mathcal U)\\land\\forall i\\in N\\;\\bigl(\\vec S(i)\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec u(i),\\prod_{j\\in N}\\vec S(j),\\mathbb R)\\bigr)\\land\\forall s\\in\\prod_{i\\in N}\\vec S(i)\\;(\\sum_{i\\in N}\\vec u(i)(s)=0)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\vec S(i)","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec u(i)","display":false},{"tex":"S_i,u_i","display":false}],"bytes":1479,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2214","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-game4-zero-sum-normal-game.md|58-df-zfc-game4-zero-sum-normal-game]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d9a25b0ac94a3598","36d7463d215be751","2a48a890cd9aeba0","3579e07be41aa5cd"]}